    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Machines Arena is an adrenaline-fueled PvP game where unique heroes battle competitively in teams of 4v4 for some pulse-pounding mayhem, delivered in a top-down perspective. Pick a hero that suits your personality, style, and killer instinct, and dive right into the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Matches: PvP battles last just 5 to 7 minutes \u2014 perfect for dominating or being dominated anytime, anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Competitive Ranked Mode \u2014 duke it out to become the ultimate champion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvE \u2018Death Run\u2019: A single-player rogue-lite mode with endless, increasingly difficult rooms packed with challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 PvP Heroes: Each hero comes with specialized abilities and weapons, offering distinct playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizations: Stand out on the battlefield with custom skins and bring your Familiar into combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exclusive PvE Hero: Play as XE, collecting permanent power-ups and customizing builds to adapt to your PvE strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Game Modes &amp; Map Types \u2014 no triumphant victory or crushing defeat is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the action with friends, link up with a team, or have some solo fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn, hard to master gameplay: Hone your skills in training rooms before bringing your best into the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flexible Controls: Choose your preferred setup, whether it\u2019s a controller or mouse and keyboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Paywalls: All current heroes are available from the start, with no additional purchases required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fair Play: Ranked mode balances hero stats to ensure a level playing field for everyone </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Machines Arena is an adrenaline-fueled PvP game where unique heroes battle competitively in teams of 4v4 for some pulse-pounding mayhem, delivered in a top-down perspective. Pick a hero that suits your personality, style, and killer instinct, and dive right into the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/0624f80b6854906ca3be1e875769a060.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Matches: PvP battles last just 5 to 7 minutes \u2014 perfect for dominating or being dominated anytime, anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Competitive Ranked Mode \u2014 duke it out to become the ultimate champion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvE \u2018Death Run\u2019: A single-player rogue-lite mode with endless, increasingly difficult rooms packed with challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/dffd9e23d29aa70ad2a7ed138ae479a3.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 PvP Heroes: Each hero comes with specialized abilities and weapons, offering distinct playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizations: Stand out on the battlefield with custom skins and bring your Familiar into combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exclusive PvE Hero: Play as XE, collecting permanent power-ups and customizing builds to adapt to your PvE strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/19a6c3fab0c2646734c2c917fdcb4a57.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Game Modes &amp; Map Types \u2014 no triumphant victory or crushing defeat is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the action with friends, link up with a team, or have some solo fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn, hard to master gameplay: Hone your skills in training rooms before bringing your best into the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flexible Controls: Choose your preferred setup, whether it\u2019s a controller or mouse and keyboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.poster.avif?t=1736857050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.webm?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539860/extras/d2327fd3f7d459e13eb5571a4afa756e.mp4?t=1736857050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Paywalls: All current heroes are available from the start, with no additional purchases required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fair Play: Ranked mode balances hero stats to ensure a level playing field for everyone </p></li></ul>",
